<p>Short drinks are cocktails that are typically served in smaller glassware, such as <a href="/cocktail-glassware/#old-fashioned-glasses">Old Fashioned Glasses</a>.</p>
<p>These drinks are usually meant to be consumed quickly and are often served over ice or with a minimal amount of mixer.</p>
